window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Starting out with a losing hand doesn't mean you have to throw the game.</b></p> <p>My forties should have been when I thrived. Instead, I'm facing them as a divorced single mother in an unfamiliar city.</p> <p>Trying to reclaim my life led me to a new man's bed… then another… and another.</p> <p>It doesn't mean anything that they're my scent matches. I already lost two decades to the wrong man, and I'm not going to fall in line with someone else just because fate says so.</p> <p>It doesn't matter that when I'm in their arms, I feel alive for the first time in years. I can't gamble with my children's happiness after everything that happened with their father. Taking the risk isn't an option.</p> <p>But these alphas want to help me rekindle a love for all the things I sacrificed to please my ex-husband, and maybe I'm not the only one among them who's broken. Maybe these alphas need me as much as I need them.</p> <p>Will Charlotte and her mates let fear stop them from grabbing the happily ever after they deserve, or will they be able to help each other heal and finally move forward together?</p> <p>Knight Life In Vegas <i>is a part of the Sin City Omegas Universe.</i></p>"; 
